'''Nebaaru-kun''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that could be obtained from the [[Nebaaru-kun and Nyanpazuru Collaboration Event|Nebaaru-kun and Nyanpazuru Collaboration]] [[Cat Capsule#Collaboration Event Capsule|Event Cat Capsule]]. It was added in [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 266
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Nebaaru-kun
|name2 = Nebaaru-kun and Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Nebaaru-kun and Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This oddly animated nattō mascot falls into the same fate as most other collaboration units, pathetic stats and terrible ability.

Its 30% chance to Slow Floating Enemies for three seconds could be useful early-game for dealing with [[Teacher Bun Bun]], but as soon as you get [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] this unit becomes completely worthless.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

